{"about_the_game":"<strong>Notice: A controller is strongly recommended to play this game </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446880/extras/27487d764c7914ead699fcbe3f82507c.avif?t=1743143863\" width=578 height=198 /></span><br><br>A new life was presented before us\u2026 New planet, new city ... But they attacked us ... And they killed our parents. But luckily Xander picked us up. We have spent all these years training, learning, becoming the best with one goal in mind. THE REVENGE<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446880/extras/86c26ba076001d379e29e65782e30be9.poster.avif?t=1743143863\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446880/extras/86c26ba076001d379e29e65782e30be9.webm?t=1743143863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446880/extras/86c26ba076001d379e29e65782e30be9.mp4?t=1743143863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Space Revenge is an action-exploration game. Get ready to assault the enemy's base and get your desired revenge!<br>With a top down perspective, twin stick controls and a sci-fi mood to explore the enemy base full of dangers. The BSO will make you feel the tension of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446880/extras/5882c8df5a1c1ae9aaacf67d55121032.avif?t=1743143863\" width=600 height=140 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446880/extras/ea6b88969622da21a7e37ff2c4526b10.avif?t=1743143863\" width=578 height=90 /></span><br><br>Game Features:<br>\ud83d\ude80 Gorg